OL,3,GNEWSAFootball pitch ruined by 'selfish'
OL,4,Avandals in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football pitch has been ruined by
OL,7,F"selfish" vandals in a car, a youth
OL,8,Fteam has said.
OL,10,FBispham Junior Football Federation in
OL,11,FBlackpool said a vehicle was seen
OL,12,Fdriving around in circles on to the
OL,13,Fpitch on Wednesday night before a
OL,14,Fperson got out and tore up the grass.
OL,16,FChairman Lisa Hannigan said the club
OL,17,Fwas due to host matches on the pitch on
OL,18,FSaturday and Sunday, but they had to be
OL,19,Fmoved due to the unplayable state of
OL,20,Fthe turf.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
