OL,3,GNEWSAFootball pitch ruined by 'selfish'
OL,4,Avandals in car
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We don't know if they intentionally
OL,7,Fset out to damage the pitch but it
OL,8,Flooks that way," Hannigan said. "It
OL,9,Fmakes me angry to think someone could
OL,10,Fbe so selfish and not consider the
OL,11,Fimplications of their actions."
